(5434302, 781610, 70484, '<td valign="top">Hopefully this will be on the front page as a big "we miss you" to Shez. But, sentiment aside, I really like this photo. The haphazard dropping of the pencil shavings is great and the action produced is really nice. Even if it were a different message I would still like it. 9 for the picture and 1 more because we really do miss Shez and you cared enough to tell her! 10</td>', 'Hopefully this will be on the front page as a big "we miss you" to Shez. But, sentiment aside, I really like this photo. The haphazard dropping of the pencil shavings is great and the action produced is really nice. Even if it were a different message I would still like it. 9 for the picture and 1 more because we really do miss Shez and you cared enough to tell her! 10', '2009-04-13 03:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
