(5434317, 780965, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to leave a comment...I really like your composition here. The use of the pencil sharpener as the zipper is genius. The pencils are set up perfectly. The only thing that I would have liked to see is for all of the top pencils to be sharp. Some of them are a little dull and that takes away from the picture a little, but that is such a little thing I didn''t take points away for it, I just think it would have helped with the balance of the picture.</td>', 'Already voted, back to leave a comment...I really like your composition here. The use of the pencil sharpener as the zipper is genius. The pencils are set up perfectly. The only thing that I would have liked to see is for all of the top pencils to be sharp. Some of them are a little dull and that takes away from the picture a little, but that is such a little thing I didn''t take points away for it, I just think it would have helped with the balance of the picture.', '2009-04-13 03:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434319, 781487, 70484, '<td valign="top">So very creative!!!!! I absolutely love this. The focus is great! The creativity is great! The subject is adorable! Well thought out and well executed! 10</td>', 'So very creative!!!!! I absolutely love this. The focus is great! The creativity is great! The subject is adorable! Well thought out and well executed! 10', '2009-04-13 03:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434320, 780011, 70484, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the entries with the hearts. I think your choice of the black background and the red heart really made this pop. I also think that the multiple pencils of the same colors also created more visual impact. Nicely done! I just noticed the colored frame around it also, It''s great! Back to bump this up.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the entries with the hearts. I think your choice of the black background and the red heart really made this pop. I also think that the multiple pencils of the same colors also created more visual impact. Nicely done! I just noticed the colored frame around it also, It''s great! Back to bump this up.', '2009-04-13 03:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434321, 781640, 70484, '<td valign="top">Someone should make a ribbon for staying in the lines :-)  I like the way you did the colors with multiple colors in each letter. I think the composition here is really good.</td>', 'Someone should make a ribbon for staying in the lines :-)  I like the way you did the colors with multiple colors in each letter. I think the composition here is really good.', '2009-04-13 03:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
