(5434679, 781532, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really fun shot. The lighting is great, the eye makeup adds to the idea of colors. I think the grass makes a nice color pop but the texture of it is a bit distracting to me. Also, her bra strap is a bit distracting as well.</td>', 'I think this is a really fun shot. The lighting is great, the eye makeup adds to the idea of colors. I think the grass makes a nice color pop but the texture of it is a bit distracting to me. Also, her bra strap is a bit distracting as well.', '2009-04-13 11:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434681, 781782, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think a less distracting background that camoflauged the subject less and more diffused lighting to eliminate the heavy shadow under the subject would make this pop more. Unless the wood adds some meaning to the photo that is going over my head, which is entirely possible.</td>', 'I think a less distracting background that camoflauged the subject less and more diffused lighting to eliminate the heavy shadow under the subject would make this pop more. Unless the wood adds some meaning to the photo that is going over my head, which is entirely possible.', '2009-04-13 11:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434683, 781696, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great colors. This has a really nice stock quality to it, it''s not overly planned or artistic but has a nice reality quality.</td>', 'Great lighting, great colors. This has a really nice stock quality to it, it''s not overly planned or artistic but has a nice reality quality.', '2009-04-13 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434685, 781472, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in this pic a lot.</td>', 'I like the texture in this pic a lot.', '2009-04-13 11:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434687, 781715, 97611, '<td valign="top">Good work</td>', 'Good work', '2009-04-13 11:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434692, 781405, 98141, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I get this. What are they jumping out of? Is it a quiver? It feels overly processed to me, nothing seems quite real.</td>', 'I don''t think I get this. What are they jumping out of? Is it a quiver? It feels overly processed to me, nothing seems quite real.', '2009-04-13 11:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
