(5434729, 781615, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get a lot of similar comments, but this is so darn cute. Excellent lighting.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get a lot of similar comments, but this is so darn cute. Excellent lighting.', '2009-04-13 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
