(5434747, 781726, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I think eggs are so photogenic (maybe that''s weird). Would be neat if they were dyed the color of the crayon touching them or something.</td>', 'Great lighting, I think eggs are so photogenic (maybe that''s weird). Would be neat if they were dyed the color of the crayon touching them or something.', '2009-04-13 12:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
