(5434754, 781090, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in focus and it''s a bit grainy. I suggest to lower your ISO and keep one point in focus so there''s something of a subject to focus on.</td>', 'Nothing is in focus and it''s a bit grainy. I suggest to lower your ISO and keep one point in focus so there''s something of a subject to focus on.', '2009-04-13 12:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
