(5434768, 781770, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good start to the challenge, this image is crisp, sharp and uses the light well to create an interesting view of color. One minor issue is the little light blooms on the celophane and in a couple of places on the crayons. There are also some unfortunate shadows that jump out of the image when looked at closely. A good solid entry into the challenge and a great way to start the rating and commentary process.  Well done.</td>', 'A good start to the challenge, this image is crisp, sharp and uses the light well to create an interesting view of color. One minor issue is the little light blooms on the celophane and in a couple of places on the crayons. There are also some unfortunate shadows that jump out of the image when looked at closely. A good solid entry into the challenge and a great way to start the rating and commentary process.  Well done.', '2009-04-13 12:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5434770, 781298, 98141, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC background, really interesting bug addition to an otherwise well-executed photo.</td>', 'FANTASTIC background, really interesting bug addition to an otherwise well-executed photo.', '2009-04-13 12:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
