(5434821, 781487, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is just so damn brilliant and innovative. My absolute favorite for a blue ribbon. I just love how you got that dog to pose for you. It must have taken quite a number of takes to get it just right. I presume you then sketched the dog from the photograph. Did you do the sketch yourself as well?<br/>Superb effort and one that I hope will be rewarded accordingly. 9</td>', 'This is just so damn brilliant and innovative. My absolute favorite for a blue ribbon. I just love how you got that dog to pose for you. It must have taken quite a number of takes to get it just right. I presume you then sketched the dog from the photograph. Did you do the sketch yourself as well?Superb effort and one that I hope will be rewarded accordingly. 9', '2009-04-13 12:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
