(5435193, 781405, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image meets the subject matter dead on. A sound demonstration of the creative process in meeting the challenge in a very unusual way. A couple of minor detail problems as the image appears to be over sharpened, but that may be a lighting artifact. The DOF could have been used more effectively. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The image meets the subject matter dead on. A sound demonstration of the creative process in meeting the challenge in a very unusual way. A couple of minor detail problems as the image appears to be over sharpened, but that may be a lighting artifact. The DOF could have been used more effectively. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-13 17:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5435195, 781601, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image meets the challenge subject matter dead on. A sound demonstration of the creative process in meeting the challenge in a very different way. A couple of minor detail problems as the image appears to be over sharpened, but that may be a lighting artifact. The DOF could have been used more effectively. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The image meets the challenge subject matter dead on. A sound demonstration of the creative process in meeting the challenge in a very different way. A couple of minor detail problems as the image appears to be over sharpened, but that may be a lighting artifact. The DOF could have been used more effectively. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-13 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
