(5435293, 781749, 101256, '<td valign="top">nother example of how the creative process works and a good demonstration of how one develops and executes an idea.  It does have a minor lighting problem that affects the image''s balance, but the overall execution is outstanding and worthy of a top twenty finish and potentially a ribbon winner. A very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'nother example of how the creative process works and a good demonstration of how one develops and executes an idea.  It does have a minor lighting problem that affects the image''s balance, but the overall execution is outstanding and worthy of a top twenty finish and potentially a ribbon winner. A very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-13 18:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5435296, 781090, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite up to the quality of the rest of the entries into this challenge, a little more thought and composition would have helped. While the author''s intent is clear (no pun intended), the overly vague image is a significant negative.</td>', 'Not quite up to the quality of the rest of the entries into this challenge, a little more thought and composition would have helped. While the author''s intent is clear (no pun intended), the overly vague image is a significant negative.', '2009-04-13 18:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
