(5435732, 781684, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the POV concept but I don''t see a strong tie between the materials and the finished image. The pallet and pencils in the ready are too little of the frame, the hand  holding  the pencil doesn''t make me think that hand is busy working to detail the sunset scene. I think this is a killer concept, but a bit more of a connection between media , artist and finished image are needed.</td>', 'I like the POV concept but I don''t see a strong tie between the materials and the finished image. The pallet and pencils in the ready are too little of the frame, the hand  holding  the pencil doesn''t make me think that hand is busy working to detail the sunset scene. I think this is a killer concept, but a bit more of a connection between media , artist and finished image are needed.', '2009-04-13 23:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5435736, 781790, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the well executed simplicity here, but the big black bars of the frame are distracting. I miss the barrel reflections on the yellow pencil, what happened there?</td>', 'I like the well executed simplicity here, but the big black bars of the frame are distracting. I miss the barrel reflections on the yellow pencil, what happened there?', '2009-04-13 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
