(5436292, 781755, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Wish the colors were a little brighter.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Wish the colors were a little brighter.', '2009-04-14 11:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436293, 781298, 80104, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Focus is pretty good and you''ve managed to seperate yourself from some of the other photos.</td>', 'Neat shot.  Focus is pretty good and you''ve managed to seperate yourself from some of the other photos.', '2009-04-14 11:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436294, 781770, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shot.  Good easter work so to speak.</td>', 'Nice colors and shot.  Good easter work so to speak.', '2009-04-14 11:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436295, 781652, 80104, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  The black background really helps this shot and the sharpening is just right.</td>', 'Neat shot.  The black background really helps this shot and the sharpening is just right.', '2009-04-14 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436296, 781132, 80104, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Too bad you have a few specs of dust, especially the one just a little to the right of center about 5/6th of the way down.  Maybe a bit white background and more saturation in the colors would have worked to really bring out the crayons.</td>', 'Neat shot.  Too bad you have a few specs of dust, especially the one just a little to the right of center about 5/6th of the way down.  Maybe a bit white background and more saturation in the colors would have worked to really bring out the crayons.', '2009-04-14 11:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436298, 781687, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although I find the reflection on the crayons a tad distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot although I find the reflection on the crayons a tad distracting.', '2009-04-14 11:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436299, 780149, 80104, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Really nice.  Proof that a crayon shot doesn''t have to be full of colors.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Really nice.  Proof that a crayon shot doesn''t have to be full of colors.  One of my favorites so far.', '2009-04-14 11:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436300, 780969, 66201, '<td valign="top">Intriguing pull towards the centre...like looking into an eye - the crayons all forming the iris. I would just make the quibble that the "green" breaks the perfect circle.</td>', 'Intriguing pull towards the centre...like looking into an eye - the crayons all forming the iris. I would just make the quibble that the "green" breaks the perfect circle.', '2009-04-14 11:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436301, 780927, 80104, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Only crayon that looks out of place and is distracting is the white one being on a white background.  Maybe a dark background would have worked better without the black colouring pencil.</td>', 'Neat shot.  Only crayon that looks out of place and is distracting is the white one being on a white background.  Maybe a dark background would have worked better without the black colouring pencil.', '2009-04-14 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436303, 781722, 80104, '<td valign="top">Where are the color stems.  I need to see the color name because I''m colorblind :-D.  Neat take.</td>', 'Where are the color stems.  I need to see the color name because I''m colorblind :-D.  Neat take.', '2009-04-14 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436304, 781782, 80104, '<td valign="top">Different shot although I don''t like the background for this one.  It''s distracting and wish it was a more seperate color from the crayon.</td>', 'Different shot although I don''t like the background for this one.  It''s distracting and wish it was a more seperate color from the crayon.', '2009-04-14 11:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436306, 781781, 80104, '<td valign="top">I like this shot with all the crayons taking up the picture.  I like the fact that you can even see the dust specs on each crayon.  I kind of wonder if a tilt the other way would have worked even better.</td>', 'I like this shot with all the crayons taking up the picture.  I like the fact that you can even see the dust specs on each crayon.  I kind of wonder if a tilt the other way would have worked even better.', '2009-04-14 11:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436308, 781672, 80104, '<td valign="top">Now there''s something you don''t see every day.  Where''s the yellow one.  Lighting is superb.</td>', 'Now there''s something you don''t see every day.  Where''s the yellow one.  Lighting is superb.', '2009-04-14 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436309, 781726, 80104, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Well done.  Too bad the background has the crease in the top section</td>', 'Neat shot.  Well done.  Too bad the background has the crease in the top section', '2009-04-14 11:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436311, 781074, 80104, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t hit me the right way.  You forget about the crayons and instead end up concentrating on the glass.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t hit me the right way.  You forget about the crayons and instead end up concentrating on the glass.', '2009-04-14 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436313, 781766, 80104, '<td valign="top">This is well done.  Must have taken a while to put together.  Too bad the shadow isn''t just a bit sharper.</td>', 'This is well done.  Must have taken a while to put together.  Too bad the shadow isn''t just a bit sharper.', '2009-04-14 11:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436316, 781793, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice try but it''s just too oversaturated for me.</td>', 'Nice try but it''s just too oversaturated for me.', '2009-04-14 11:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436318, 781779, 80104, '<td valign="top">This is well done.  The pencil is sharp and the fact that only one pencil shows text actually works.</td>', 'This is well done.  The pencil is sharp and the fact that only one pencil shows text actually works.', '2009-04-14 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436320, 781738, 80104, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t hit me the right way.  I want to focus on the pencil sticking up but the end seems out of focus.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t hit me the right way.  I want to focus on the pencil sticking up but the end seems out of focus.', '2009-04-14 11:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436322, 780924, 80104, '<td valign="top">Although it doesn''t really seem to meet the challenge whatsoever the picture also seems to lack contrast.</td>', 'Although it doesn''t really seem to meet the challenge whatsoever the picture also seems to lack contrast.', '2009-04-14 11:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436324, 781304, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Too bad the colors don''t pop out at you as much.  Also the white background seems too bright in this picture and takes away from looking at the crayons.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Too bad the colors don''t pop out at you as much.  Also the white background seems too bright in this picture and takes away from looking at the crayons.', '2009-04-14 11:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
