(5436341, 781736, 80104, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  I like the binding at the bottom left.  I actually wish the hand was not blurred.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  I like the binding at the bottom left.  I actually wish the hand was not blurred.', '2009-04-14 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436342, 781159, 80104, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  My first impression wasn''t great but staring at it I like it more and more.  There''s a tone to it that seems really pleasing.  Just about like a sun setting and the last one standing is... well... still standing.</td>', 'I like this shot.  My first impression wasn''t great but staring at it I like it more and more.  There''s a tone to it that seems really pleasing.  Just about like a sun setting and the last one standing is... well... still standing.', '2009-04-14 11:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
