(5436354, 781610, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot although it doesn''t work for me.  But I have to say...  the sharpenings look like nuts you''d get from McDonald''s Sundays.</td>', 'Interesting shot although it doesn''t work for me.  But I have to say...  the sharpenings look like nuts you''d get from McDonald''s Sundays.', '2009-04-14 11:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436356, 781671, 80104, '<td valign="top">Uh oh...  Someone''s in trouble.  Wish the focus was a tad sharper on the boy.</td>', 'Uh oh...  Someone''s in trouble.  Wish the focus was a tad sharper on the boy.', '2009-04-14 11:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436357, 781771, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Just not a very outgoing subject.  I think a different color would have worked for the crayon standing up.  The black looses a little definition.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Just not a very outgoing subject.  I think a different color would have worked for the crayon standing up.  The black looses a little definition.', '2009-04-14 11:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436359, 781457, 80104, '<td valign="top">This is really well done.  I quite enjoy this picture.  The focus does it justice.  The fact that the crayon at the back of the pencil is focused also adds to the shot.</td>', 'This is really well done.  I quite enjoy this picture.  The focus does it justice.  The fact that the crayon at the back of the pencil is focused also adds to the shot.', '2009-04-14 11:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
