(5436361, 781669, 80104, '<td valign="top">Neat way of setting up the shot.  I knot you wanted to keep the stems of the pencils in the shot but I might have cropped it just a tad more if I were you.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Neat way of setting up the shot.  I knot you wanted to keep the stems of the pencils in the shot but I might have cropped it just a tad more if I were you.  Nice lighting.', '2009-04-14 11:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
