(5436371, 780760, 80104, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different angle closeup to the crayons and only part of the drawing in the shot would have made for a better photo.  Right now it just seems so so.</td>', 'Maybe a different angle closeup to the crayons and only part of the drawing in the shot would have made for a better photo.  Right now it just seems so so.', '2009-04-14 11:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436372, 781511, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is a very cute, creative idea...it took some time to create this...good lighting, excellent focus</td>', 'this is a very cute, creative idea...it took some time to create this...good lighting, excellent focus', '2009-04-14 11:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436373, 781535, 80104, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  I love the fact that the boy seems desaturated along with the background but the colors are really "colorful".  A tad brighter maybe?</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  I love the fact that the boy seems desaturated along with the background but the colors are really "colorful".  A tad brighter maybe?', '2009-04-14 11:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436374, 781779, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this...I like that they are bright and clear and not dull and flat</td>', 'I like the colors in this...I like that they are bright and clear and not dull and flat', '2009-04-14 11:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436376, 781640, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The colors are bright as is the picture.  The hand seems to be a bit off in color though.  Just about like it''s been over a fire cooking.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The colors are bright as is the picture.  The hand seems to be a bit off in color though.  Just about like it''s been over a fire cooking.', '2009-04-14 11:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
