(5439245, 781296, 58457, '<td valign="top">I''m really curious to see how you did this.  I thought of a similar idea, but couldn''t think of the "trick" of photographing it.  This is well done, and quite convincing.  I''m guessing that the "cuffs" are on pieces of card and worn on your/your model''s wrists.  Very clever and maybe the best in challenge (though I haven''t seen them all yet).</td>', 'I''m really curious to see how you did this.  I thought of a similar idea, but couldn''t think of the "trick" of photographing it.  This is well done, and quite convincing.  I''m guessing that the "cuffs" are on pieces of card and worn on your/your model''s wrists.  Very clever and maybe the best in challenge (though I haven''t seen them all yet).', '2009-04-15 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439334, 781601, 88136, '<td valign="top">flash seems a bit overpowering. nice bright colors though</td>', 'flash seems a bit overpowering. nice bright colors though', '2009-04-15 19:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
