(5441872, 781487, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sketch!  What a clever idea.  LOL you have that dog soooo well trained.  With this kind of talent, I''m thinking you could have a new business in the making :D</td>', 'Beautiful sketch!  What a clever idea.  LOL you have that dog soooo well trained.  With this kind of talent, I''m thinking you could have a new business in the making :D', '2009-04-17 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441875, 780667, 67697, '<td valign="top">The background is very pretty.  I like the combination of the pencils and picture.  I''m not sure tho I understand why you chose to have a variation in lighting on the unused pencils.  Having the yellow one at the bottom being the brightest seems out of place.  6</td>', 'The background is very pretty.  I like the combination of the pencils and picture.  I''m not sure tho I understand why you chose to have a variation in lighting on the unused pencils.  Having the yellow one at the bottom being the brightest seems out of place.  6', '2009-04-17 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441876, 781219, 67697, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  This is such a creative idea.  Love it!</td>', 'Adorable!  This is such a creative idea.  Love it!', '2009-04-17 12:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441878, 781615, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol this is so true of puppies... anything they can get their teeth into is toast.  cute idea  :)</td>', 'lol this is so true of puppies... anything they can get their teeth into is toast.  cute idea  :)', '2009-04-17 12:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441879, 781698, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how you used a different background for a typical water type of shot.  Unexpected for sure.  The colors are great and I love the bubbles!</td>', 'I like how you used a different background for a typical water type of shot.  Unexpected for sure.  The colors are great and I love the bubbles!', '2009-04-17 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441880, 781767, 67697, '<td valign="top">Adorable child!  I love those eyes - such a pretty blue.  Great idea to have a blue crayon to complement them.  Love the lighting. 7</td>', 'Adorable child!  I love those eyes - such a pretty blue.  Great idea to have a blue crayon to complement them.  Love the lighting. 7', '2009-04-17 12:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441882, 781722, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great idea to use wood pencils that don''t match the color of the crayon.  I think since the main subject is the burst of color, I would like to have seen all of the pencil points be in focus and maybe move the center to follow the rule of thirds.  6</td>', 'Great idea to use wood pencils that don''t match the color of the crayon.  I think since the main subject is the burst of color, I would like to have seen all of the pencil points be in focus and maybe move the center to follow the rule of thirds.  6', '2009-04-17 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441885, 781090, 67697, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the OOF was intentional or not.  That''s too bad because this looks like it is a pretty arrangement and I would like to have seen it all in focus. 4</td>', 'Not sure if the OOF was intentional or not.  That''s too bad because this looks like it is a pretty arrangement and I would like to have seen it all in focus. 4', '2009-04-17 12:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
