(5442189, 781532, 99311, '<td valign="top">I like the way ,the central theme ''crayons'' and ''colour'' runs through the scene. According to me the picture would have benefited with the girl alone and the colour in her face being the centre of focus ... somehow with too many things it has weakened the picture as it looks a bit busy, it is making the eye wander around</td>', 'I like the way ,the central theme ''crayons'' and ''colour'' runs through the scene. According to me the picture would have benefited with the girl alone and the colour in her face being the centre of focus ... somehow with too many things it has weakened the picture as it looks a bit busy, it is making the eye wander around', '2009-04-17 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
