(5443465, 781549, 98663, '<td valign="top">Cool. That''s weird how there is white right below the color of those pencils very interesting.... anyways Cool picture I like that the pencils "sharpened point" (where the wood turns to color) almost seems to make a circle rather then a heart then the points make the heart. Colors could have popped a little more however....</td>', 'Cool. That''s weird how there is white right below the color of those pencils very interesting.... anyways Cool picture I like that the pencils "sharpened point" (where the wood turns to color) almost seems to make a circle rather then a heart then the points make the heart. Colors could have popped a little more however....', '2009-04-19 03:35:20.000000', NULL, 1);
