(5447409, 781551, 36141, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this challenge, but your photo should have won blue in my opinion. Far the best photo in this challenge. Beautiful, artistic and creative take on the subject. Superb choice of colors and composition. A real gem. Peeked into your portfolio and enjoyed the views.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-21 18:40:36.</i></td>', 'I didn''t vote this challenge, but your photo should have won blue in my opinion. Far the best photo in this challenge. Beautiful, artistic and creative take on the subject. Superb choice of colors and composition. A real gem. Peeked into your portfolio and enjoyed the views.', '2009-04-21 19:39:45.000000', '2009-04-21 19:40:36.000000', 0),
