(5448915, 780987, 70000, '<td valign="top">What an awesome amount of work for this image! I really love the design in paint and the crayon designs, but I find the chains incredibly distracting. In my opinion this would have been much stronger without them. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'What an awesome amount of work for this image! I really love the design in paint and the crayon designs, but I find the chains incredibly distracting. In my opinion this would have been much stronger without them. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2009-04-22 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 0);
