(5458251, 781615, 37719, '<td valign="top">Funny..shot and my observation. Great shot!  I voted it a 9 and thought it would do much better.  I was reading through the comments I made in this challenge and noticed that the image that won the blue I commented that it would have been better if the dog had a pencil in his mouth and voted it lower than this one by more than a few.  I like the feel/mood of this shot - DoF is good, colors are good, just a fun image.  Should have placed better IMO.</td>', 'Funny..shot and my observation. Great shot!  I voted it a 9 and thought it would do much better.  I was reading through the comments I made in this challenge and noticed that the image that won the blue I commented that it would have been better if the dog had a pencil in his mouth and voted it lower than this one by more than a few.  I like the feel/mood of this shot - DoF is good, colors are good, just a fun image.  Should have placed better IMO.', '2009-04-29 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
