(5557163, 781487, 31637, '<td valign="top">Back for another look, mostly at your details you wrote. One of my dog''s birthday is coming up, looking for tips on how to keep them still! lol...<br/>Is this your fox terrier you once told me about? surprisingly similar looking to my youngest one, Conan who is chihuahua according to his parents papers...but definitely has the look of a Fox, who probably got his fathers genes, my oldest one Lupo...who is a dedicated alpha male. I have to feed them in separate rooms!...keep up the good work, your one of the best.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-02 23:30:59.</i></td>', 'Back for another look, mostly at your details you wrote. One of my dog''s birthday is coming up, looking for tips on how to keep them still! lol...Is this your fox terrier you once told me about? surprisingly similar looking to my youngest one, Conan who is chihuahua according to his parents papers...but definitely has the look of a Fox, who probably got his fathers genes, my oldest one Lupo...who is a dedicated alpha male. I have to feed them in separate rooms!...keep up the good work, your one of the best.', '2009-07-03 00:30:24.000000', '2009-07-03 00:30:59.000000', 0),
